    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist our new game:</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;Wife of my Neighbor&quot; is a visual novel in which you have to help your neighbor in a special way. His wife needs more attention, and you are the only one who can help her.<br><br>How exactly - that's up to you! You can either help the couple by becoming their &quot;family therapist&quot; or just help the wife with her lack of attention. Either way, you are sure to make your neighbor's wife happy!<br><br>Spend time with her, help her with her morning jog and household chores, prove that you can be trusted in everything!",
